                    telegram No. 113 of July 24 from Grew to
                        Byrnes (file No. 800.00
                    Summaries/7–2445).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1078-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1078-f2-content">
                <p>R. C. Skrine Stevenson.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
